          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua, monai, ndi mbanga kukengesha musoko eu udibo binyika dina dianyi, ne nuenu nenuhange kukengeshibua, anyi? Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Kanuena nuhanga kukengeshibua; bualu bua nembikile muele wa nvita bua kutaha nʼau bonso ba ha buloba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.29",
